Package: PolandTripPlanner
Title: Poland Trip Planning with Route Optimization and Transport Suggestions
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Kamilla", "Tadjibaeva", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "kamilla.tadjibaeva@student.edu"),
    person("Nijat", "Kazimli", role = "aut",
           email = "nctkzmli@gmail.com"))
Description: Provides tools for planning trips to Poland including intelligent
    time allocation across cities based on their cultural and historical
    significance, scenic route discovery that identifies interesting stops
    along the way, optimal visit-order routing via a C++ Travelling Salesman
    Problem solver, and per-leg transport suggestions filtered by user
    preferences. Uses S3 and R6 class systems, C++ via Rcpp for
    performance-critical computations, and defensive programming throughout.
